* Remaining = 1000 - 300 = 700 students
4. Exit B: 3/5 of remaining students
* 3/5 of 700 = (3 × 700)/5 = 2100/5 = 420 students
5. Exit C: All remaining students
* Students through Exit C = 700 - 420 = 280 students
