A tub of ice cream that was $13 is now just $11. A packet of milk got a 50 cent discount. How much will you save if you grab 2 tubs of ice cream and 4 packets of milk?,A tub of ice cream costing $13 is now sold at $11. A packet of milk was sold at a discount of $0.5. How much will you save if you buy 2 tubs of ice cream and 4 packets of milk?,6,6,6,6,"Let me solve this step by step.

