"If you split a bag of flour into 8 chunks, each weighing 2 kg, how many kgs of flour were there in three bags altogether before you divided it up?","A bag of flour is divided into 8 portions of 2 kilograms each. How much flour (in kilograms) was in three bags in total, before it was divided into portions?",48,48,48,48,"Let me solve this step by step.

